{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a wacky adventure with 'Back To School', an arcade game set in a vibrant cartoon world. At the center of the game is a seemingly ordinary yellow bus that suddenly comes to life, defying gravity, physics and sometimes even common sense! Your mission? Tap continuously to chase the bus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each failed attempt leads to an over-the-top cartoon death, with a fun repertoire of hilarious animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you are with your reflexes, the closer you will be to catching the bus. Challenge your friends to get the best time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you fast enough to catch the craziest bus ever? Test your reflexes, embrace the chaos and prepare to laugh until you cry.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789760?t=1750867107","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789760?t=1750867107","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789760/f9d071923fb98f3ce758a072e59286a47fd9c242/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750867107","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789760/f9d071923fb98f3ce758a072e59286a47fd9c242/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750867107","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a wacky adventure with 'Back To School', an arcade game set in a vibrant cartoon world. At the center of the game is a seemingly ordinary yellow bus that suddenly comes to life, defying gravity, physics and sometimes even common sense! Your mission? Tap continuously to chase the bus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each failed attempt leads to an over-the-top cartoon death, with a fun repertoire of hilarious animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap